:: Campus Physics
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !School.isSchoolDay()>><<goto "Linkon University">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("campus-physics", "Bloomshore District — Linkon University")>>\
<<if School.earlyArrival("physics")>>\
<<schoolEarly "physics">>\
<<schoolStudyBefore "physics">>\
<<actionIcon "exit">><<link "Leave the classroom <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Linkon University">><</link>>
<<elseif $schoolStudyBefore && $schoolStudyBefore.roomKey === "physics">>\
<<goto "Physics Study Transition">>\
<<elseif !Flags.get(PhysicsClass.FIRST_FLAG) && PhysicsClass.isInSession()>>\
<<goto "Physics Class Begin">>\
<<elseif PhysicsClass.needsEnd()>>\
<<run PhysicsClass.rollEnd()>>\
<<run PhysicsClass.markEndDone()>>\
<<goto "Physics Class End">>\
<<else>>\
You are in the physics classroom.<<if PhysicsClass.isInSession()>>\
<<run PhysicsClass.rollDuring()>>\
 <<= $physicsDuringText>><<= $physicsDuringEffects>>
<<schoolFocus "physics">>\
<<else>>\
<<actionIcon "exit">><<link "Leave the classroom <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Linkon University">><</link>>
<</if>>\
<</if>>

:: Physics Study Transition
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !$schoolStudyBefore || $schoolStudyBefore.roomKey !== "physics">><<goto "Campus Physics">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("campus-physics", "Bloomshore District — Linkon University")>>\
<<set _sb to $schoolStudyBefore>>\
<<unset $schoolStudyBefore>>\
You study diligently, until the bell rings. <<= _sb.effectMarkup>>

<<link "Next">>\
<<if !Flags.get(PhysicsClass.FIRST_FLAG) && PhysicsClass.isInSession()>>\
<<goto "Physics Class Begin">>\
<<else>>\
<<goto "Campus Physics">>\
<</if>>\
<</link>>

:: Physics Class Begin
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !School.isSchoolDay() || !PhysicsClass.isInSession()>><<goto "Campus Physics">><</if>>\
<<run Flags.set(PhysicsClass.FIRST_FLAG)>>\
<<run World.setLocation("campus-physics", "Bloomshore District — Linkon University")>>\
The bell rings, signalling that class has begun. With the final signal, Professor Lorenz walks into the classroom, his handsome face stern and stoic. He sets a stack of papers on his desk, sweeping a hand through his tousled, white locks of hair.

“All right everyone, class has begun. Take your seats at once.”

<<pronouns "player">>\
Golden eyes scan the room, before they finally fall on you. He turns his chin up, speaking lowly. “Another Xia… You are <<Caleb>>’s little <<gendered "brother" "sister" "sibling">>, aren’t you?” <<pronouns "caleb">>\
You sink into your seat at the mention of your older <<gendered "brother" "sister" "sibling">>. The last thing you wanted was to be compared to <<Caleb>> and <<his>> exceptional grades, looks, and athletics… <<stress "+">>

“... <<He>> was always quite the show off with <<his>> gravity evol,” Professor Lorenz began, “I have high hopes you won’t be as much of a nuisance as <<he>> was.”

Students began to whisper pointedly amongst each other, your face and ears burning with heat. With a simple raise and sweep of his hand, Professor Lorenz silenced the class once more.

<<link "Next">><<goto "Campus Physics">><</link>>

:: Physics Class End
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !$physicsEnd>><<goto "Linkon University">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("campus-physics", "Bloomshore District — Linkon University")>>\
<<print $physicsEnd.text>>
<<gap>>
<<link `"Next <span class='action-time'>(" + School.formatActionMinutes($physicsEnd.minutes) + ")</span>"`>>\
<<run World.advance($physicsEnd.minutes)>>\
<<unset $physicsEnd>>\
<<goto "Linkon University">>\
<</link>>

:: Physics Focus Event
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !$physicsFocus>><<goto "Campus Physics">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("campus-physics", "Bloomshore District — Linkon University")>>\
<<= $physicsFocus.text>>
<<gap "sm">>
<div class="physics-focus-choices">\
<<for _choice range $physicsFocus.choices>>\
<<capture _choice>>\
<div class="physics-focus-choice"><<link `_choice.label`>>\
<<run PhysicsClass.applyFocusChoice(_choice.id)>>\
<<goto "Physics Focus Result">>\
<</link>><<= _choice.previewMarkup>></div>\
<</capture>>\
<</for>>\
</div>

:: Physics Focus Result
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !$physicsFocusResult>><<goto "Campus Physics">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("campus-physics", "Bloomshore District — Linkon University")>>\
<<= $physicsFocusResult.text>><<= $physicsFocusResult.effectsMarkup>>
<<gap>>
<<link "Next">>\
<<run PhysicsClass.clearFocusEvent()>>\
<<goto "Campus Physics">>\
<</link>>
